{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2022-02-24 18:40:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES $400 MILLION ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 24, 2022 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN ACCELERATED SHARE REPURCHASE ("ASR") AGREEMENT WITH GOLDMAN SACHS & CO. LLC ("GOLDMAN SACHS") TO REPURCHASE $400 MILLION OF MOSAIC\'S COMMON STOCK. UNDER THE ASR AGREEMENT, MOSAIC WILL MAKE A PAYMENT OF $400 MILLION TO GOLDMAN SACHS AND WILL RECEIVE AN INITIAL DELIVERY OF APPROXIMATELY 7.1 MILLION SHARES OF MOSAIC\'S COMMON STOCK ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022.'}